
=== 1. 정상 (toolUse 로 끝, 마지막 줄 개행 없음) ===
events: start,text_start,text_delta,text_delta,text_end,toolcall_start,toolcall_delta,toolcall_delta,toolcall_end,done
방출된 partial 객체 개수(같은 객체면 1): 1
toolcall_delta 때마다 arguments: {"path":"a."} -> {"path":"a.txt"}
result: {"stopReason":"toolUse","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hello"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"t1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"a.txt"}}],"usage":3}
요청 url/auth: /api/stream Bearer TOKEN
요청 body 키: [ 'model', 'context', 'options' ] | options 키: [ 'reasoning', 'metadata' ]
body 문자열에 SECRET 포함? false

=== 2. 터미널 이벤트 없이 EOF ===
events: start,text_start,text_delta,error | stopReason: error | Connection closed by proxy server before the response completed | content: [{"type":"text","text":"partial answer"}]

=== 3. HTTP 500 + {error} ===
events: error | stopReason: error | Proxy error: upstream down

=== 4. toolcall_end 없이 끊김: partialJson 잔존? ===
stopReason: error | content: [{"type":"toolCall","id":"t9","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"b"},"partialJson":"{\"path\": \"b"}]

=== 5. 중단 ===
events: start,text_start,text_delta,error | stopReason: aborted | Request aborted by user
